                                    Cmd: "tbcs battle GEN_9_SINGLES @s vs rctmod:rurik_ironshot onwin {1: ['cobbledollars give @1 350', 'tag @1 add defeated_rurik_ironshot', '@2 say Perimeter integrity: compromised. Fine. The Acting Manager signs for everything past this gate anyway - up the fence line, tripod and clipboard. Tell Silva Longscope I logged an incident.', 'easy_npc delete @2'], 2: ['cobbledollars remove @2 120', '@1 say Inventory protected. The Company thanks you for stress-testing the intake gate.']}"
                                },
