                            ],
                            Label: "yes_button"
                        }
                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "It is you. The founder, this deep in a Company acquisition and still walking. Half the floor thinks you are a rumor payroll made up to keep us honest."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "I have orders. I have a family paid in Company scrip. Do not make me do this. But I am going to."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Officer - late recognition",
                    Label: "late"
