                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "Hold at the gate, resident. This preserve is a Company specimen acquisition site. Everything past the fence is inventory under appraisal, and foot traffic through live inventory is unlicensed handling. Unlicensed handling is a conversation with me."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "The family that used to run this preserve has been transitioned. The specimens belong to the Company now, and the Company does not do trespass. It does engagements. Would you like one?"
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Officer - the gate post",
                    Label: "gate_hail"
                },
